c-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-21" href="#Frequently_Asked_Questions" >常見問題解答</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-22" href="#What_is_potato_deep_processing" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_17" data-source="" data-orig="What is potato deep processing">What is potato deep processing</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-23" href="#What_are_the_main_products_of_potato_deep_processing" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_18" data-source="" data-orig="What are the main products of potato deep processing">What are the main products of potato deep processing</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-24" href="#How_do_I_choose_the_right_potato_ingredient_for_my_application" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_19" data-source="" data-orig="How do I choose the right potato ingredient for my application">How do I choose the right potato ingredient for my application</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-25" href="#What_are_the_benefits_of_using_potato_flakes" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_20" data-source="" data-orig="What are the benefits of using potato flakes">What are the benefits of using potato flakes</span>?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-26" href="#What_quality_standards_should_potato_deep_processing_factories_follow" ><span class ="tr_" id="tr_21" data-source="" data-orig="What quality standards should potato deep processing factories follow">What quality standards should potato deep processing factories follow</span>?</a></li></ul></li></ul></nav></div><h2 data-start="226" data-end="248"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_Introduction"></span><strong data-start="229" data-end="248">1. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_22" data-source="" data-orig="Introduction">Introduction</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="250" data-end="804"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_23" data-source="" data-orig="Potato deep processing refers to industrial methods that transform fresh potatoes into value‑added ingredients and products used across food manufacturing sectors">Potato deep processing refers to industrial methods that transform fresh potatoes into value‑added ingredients and products used across food manufacturing sectors</span>, 包括零食, 麵包店, 方便食品, 和工業配方. 馬鈴薯因其豐富的澱粉含量而成為一種多功能原料, 功能特性, 以及在各種食品基質中的適應性. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_24" data-source="" data-orig="The global potato deep processing industry continues expanding due to rising demand for convenient and nutritious food ingredients">The global potato deep processing industry continues expanding due to rising demand for convenient and nutritious food ingredients</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_25" data-source="" data-orig="MDPI">MDPI</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p><p data-start="250" data-end="804"><a href="/zh-tw/"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_26" data-source="" data-orig="Visit our homepage to learn more">Visit our homepage to learn more</span></a></p><hr data-start="806" data-end="809" /><h2 data-start="811" data-end="863"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Potato_Raw_Material_and_Selection_Criteria"></span><strong data-start="814" data-end="863">2. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_27" data-source="" data-orig="Potato Raw Material and Selection Criteria">Potato Raw Material and Selection Criteria</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="865" data-end="1255"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_28" data-source="" data-orig="Successful deep processing begins with selecting suitable potato varieties">Successful deep processing begins with selecting suitable potato varieties</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_29" data-source="" data-orig="High dry matter content and low reducing sugar levels are preferred because they influence product yield">High dry matter content and low reducing sugar levels are preferred because they influence product yield</span>, 質地, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_30" data-source="" data-orig="color">color</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_31" data-source="" data-orig="and flavor during processing">and flavor during processing</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_32" data-source="" data-orig="Potatoes with low levels of reducing sugars also reduce unwanted browning during thermal steps such as blanching and drying">Potatoes with low levels of reducing sugars also reduce unwanted browning during thermal steps such as blanching and drying</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_33" data-source="" data-orig="MDPI">MDPI</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="1257" data-end="1260" /><h2 data-start="1262" data-end="1321"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Key_Deep_Processing_Products_and_Their_Production"></span><strong data-start="1265" data-end="1321">3. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_34" data-source="" data-orig="Key Deep Processing Products and Their Production">Key Deep Processing Products and Their Production</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="1323" data-end="1348"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="31_Potato_Flakes"></span><strong data-start="1327" data-end="1348">3.1 洋芋片</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1350" data-end="1690"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_35" data-source="" data-orig="Potato flakes are dehydrated potato granules or sheets produced by cooking peeled potatoes">Potato flakes are dehydrated potato granules or sheets produced by cooking peeled potatoes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_36" data-source="" data-orig="mashing into slurry">mashing into slurry</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_37" data-source="" data-orig="and drying using drum or flash dryers">and drying using drum or flash dryers</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_38" data-source="" data-orig="These flakes rapidly rehydrate when re‑introduced to water">These flakes rapidly rehydrate when re‑introduced to water</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_39" data-source="" data-orig="making them highly efficient for instant mashed potato formulations and ingredient blends">making them highly efficient for instant mashed potato formulations and ingredient blends</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_40" data-source="" data-orig="MDPI">MDPI</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p><p data-start="1692" data-end="1720"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_41" data-source="" data-orig="✔">✔</span> <strong data-start="1694" data-end="1718"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_42" data-source="" data-orig="Production Overview">Production Overview</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="1721" data-end="1950"><li data-start="1721" data-end="1819"><p data-start="1723" data-end="1819"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_43" data-source="" data-orig="Washing and peeling → Cutting and cooking → Mashing">Washing and peeling → Cutting and cooking → Mashing</span> / <span class ="tr_" id="tr_44" data-source="" data-orig="refining → Drying → Cooling → Packaging">refining → Drying → Cooling → Packaging</span>.</p></li><li data-start="1820" data-end="1950"><p data-start="1822" data-end="1950"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_45" data-source="" data-orig="Final form may vary from granular to flake structures according to end‑use specifications">Final form may vary from granular to flake structures according to end‑use specifications</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_46" data-source="" data-orig="MDPI">MDPI</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p></li></ul><p><a href="/zh-tw/products/"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_47" data-source="" data-orig="Go check our product">Go check our product</span></a></p><hr data-start="1952" data-end="1955" /><h3 data-start="1957" data-end="1984"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="32_Potato_Granules"></span><strong data-start="1961" data-end="1984">3.2 馬鈴薯顆粒</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1986" data-end="2253"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_48" data-source="" data-orig="Potato granules are similar to flakes but generally possess a more uniform spherical or pelletized structure">Potato granules are similar to flakes but generally possess a more uniform spherical or pelletized structure</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_49" data-source="" data-orig="They are widely used in ready‑to‑eat meals">They are widely used in ready‑to‑eat meals</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_50" data-source="" data-orig="industrial sauces">industrial sauces</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_51" data-source="" data-orig="and formulations requiring uniform hydration properties">and formulations requiring uniform hydration properties</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_52" data-source="" data-orig="MDPI">MDPI</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="2255" data-end="2258" /><h3 data-start="2260" data-end="2285"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="33_Potato_Starch"></span><strong data-start="2264" data-end="2285">3.3 馬鈴薯澱粉</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2287" data-end="2639"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_53" data-source="" data-orig="Potato starch is extracted from washed and crushed potatoes via wet milling">Potato starch is extracted from washed and crushed potatoes via wet milling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_54" data-source="" data-orig="sedimentation">sedimentation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_55" data-source="" data-orig="and drying">and drying</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_56" data-source="" data-orig="It is a major industrial ingredient due to its excellent gel strength">It is a major industrial ingredient due to its excellent gel strength</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_57" data-source="" data-orig="clarity">clarity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_58" data-source="" data-orig="and thickening properties">and thickening properties</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_59" data-source="" data-orig="Starch has applications beyond food">Starch has applications beyond food</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_60" data-source="" data-orig="including biodegradable packaging">including biodegradable packaging</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_61" data-source="" data-orig="adhesives">adhesives</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_62" data-source="" data-orig="and pharmaceuticals">and pharmaceuticals</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.sohu.com/a/756598993_121123790?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_63" data-source="" data-orig="sohu.com">sohu.com</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="2641" data-end="2644" /><h2 data-start="2646" data-end="2702"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_Industrial_Processing_Steps_Typical_Workflow"></span><strong data-start="2649" data-end="2702">4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_64" data-source="" data-orig="Industrial Processing Steps">Industrial Processing Steps</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_65" data-source="" data-orig="Typical Workflow">Typical Workflow</span>)</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="2704" data-end="2779"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_66" data-source="" data-orig="A modern potato deep processing line usually includes the following stages">A modern potato deep processing line usually includes the following stages</span>:</p><h3 data-start="2781" data-end="2813"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="41_Cleaning_and_Sorting"></span><strong data-start="2785" data-end="2813">4.1 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_67" data-source="" data-orig="Cleaning and Sorting">Cleaning and Sorting</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2815" data-end="2938"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="Removing soil">Removing soil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="stones">stones</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="and debris