tart="3312" data-end="3345"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="44_Drying_or_Dehydration"></span><strong data-start="3316" data-end="3345">4.4 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="Drying or Dehydration">Drying or Dehydration</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3347" data-end="3526"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Drying methods such as drum drying or flash drying are used to remove moisture to shelf‑stable levels while preserving functional properties">Drying methods such as drum drying or flash drying are used to remove moisture to shelf‑stable levels while preserving functional properties</span>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill"><a class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" href="https://www.mdpi.com/2304-8158/14/10/1758?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="MDPI">MDPI</span></span></span></span></a></span></span></p><hr data-start="3528" data-end="3531" /><h2 data-start="3533" data-end="3577"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Functional_Properties_and_Benefits"></span><strong data-start="3536" data-end="3577">5. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Functional Properties and Benefits">Functional Properties and Benefits</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="3579" data-end="3655"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Potato ingredients provide sev